WEBVTT

00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:24,420
Do you use the silver side up or the black side up on the grounding pad that came with the rife. That's a great question. You want to be putting the silver side against your skin, the black side away from you.

00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:35,420
If you look in your rife tutorial, there should be each of you should have received not only the binder that we sent you.

00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:54,420
That has all of the basic rife information, but there should have been a little booklet, depending upon the the generation of the of the rife machine that you have. It's either an F 117 or an F 122 and those are the two different types of generators that have currently been put out by true rife.

00:00:54,420 --> 00:01:07,420
When you open up that little pamphlet or booklet in there, it will give you some directions on how to utilize the grounding mat and they will be able to reiterate for you exactly the side to use it.

00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:26,420
If you're going to be sitting on it and you want to put it as a chair underneath you, you just want to make sure that the black side is facing away from you and that you're sitting on the gray side. If you're going to be keeping it on the ground underneath your feet, you'd want to do the same thing black side away from you. Set that set your feet on top of it.

